<component>
    <div v-flex="" class="case-pane doc-pane">
        <h2>{t("case.menu.context.title")}</h2>

        <Card title="组件说明">
            <p>Context Menu 是 RML 的右键菜单组件，标签为 kebab-case <code>context-menu</code>。包裹目标区域后，右键点击触发菜单弹出。</p>
            <p>核心概念：context-menu 包裹触发区域；menu-item 定义菜单项，label 显示文案，icon 添加图标，on-click 绑定命令；menu-separator 分组分隔；menu-item 内嵌 menu-item 形成子菜单。</p>
        </Card>

        <Card title="API">
            <Table columns={api_columns} rows={api_rows} bordered="" stripe="" />
        </Card>

        <Card title="示例代码">
            <CodeEditor value={code_sample} />
        </Card>

        <Card title="演示效果">
            <p>{context_status}</p>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>基础右键菜单</h3>
                <p>在下方区域右键点击，触发上下文菜单：</p>
                <context-menu>
                    <div>{t("case.menu.context.target")}</div>
                    <menu-item label="Open" icon="FolderOpen" on-click={on_open} />
                    <menu-separator />
                    <menu-item label="Copy" icon="BookOpen" on-click={on_copy} />
                    <menu-item label="Cut" on-click={on_cut} />
                    <menu-item label="Paste" on-click={on_paste} />
                </context-menu>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>子菜单</h3>
                <p>menu-item 内嵌 menu-item 形成子菜单，右键点击展开：</p>
                <context-menu>
                    <div>{t("case.menu.context.target")}</div>
                    <menu-item label="New">
                        <menu-item label="File" icon="File" on-click={on_new_file} />
                        <menu-item label="Folder" icon="Folder" on-click={on_new_folder} />
                    </menu-item>
                </context-menu>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>图标与分隔符</h3>
                <p>icon 属性添加图标，menu-separator 分组分隔：</p>
                <context-menu>
                    <div>{t("case.menu.context.target")}</div>
                    <menu-item label="Open" icon="FolderOpen" on-click={on_open} />
                    <menu-item label="Copy" icon="BookOpen" on-click={on_copy} />
                    <menu-separator />
                    <menu-item label="Delete" icon="Settings" on-click={on_delete} />
                </context-menu>
            </div>
        </Card>
    </div>
</component>
